 (41,234,1,73,NULL,'O you folded in garments!'),
 (42,234,4,74,NULL,'And your garments keep free from stain!'),
 (43,234,21,76,NULL,'upon them will be green Garments of fine silk and heavy brocade,and they will be bracelets of silver;'),
 (44,235,58,2,NULL,'"....but enter the gate with humility in posture and in words..."'),
 (45,235,31,4,NULL,'....We shall expel out of you all the evil in you,and admit you to a Gate of great honour.'),
 (46,235,154,4,NULL,'And (on another occasion) we said:"Enter the gate with humility;"'),
 (47,235,23,5,NULL,'They said: "Assault them at the (proper) Gate: when once you are in,victory will be yours;"'),
