 (49,235,161,7,NULL,'Dwell in this town and eat therein as you wish, but say the word of humility and enter the gate in a posture of humility:'),
 (50,235,67,12,NULL,'Further he said: "O my sons! enter not all by one gate:enter you by different gates.'),
 (51,235,23,13,NULL,'And angels shall enter unto them from every gate (with the salutation):'),
