 (53,235,44,15,NULL,'To it are seven gates: for each of those Gates is a(special) class (of sinners) aassigned.'),
 (54,235,29,16,NULL,'"So enter the gates of Hell, to dwell therein.Thus evil indeed is the abode of the arrogant."'),
 (55,236,80,17,NULL,'Say "o my Lord! let my entry be by the gate of truth and honour, and likewise my exit by the gate of truth and honour;"'),
 (56,236,77,23,NULL,'Until we open on them a gate leading to a severe punishment:then looked!they will be plunged in despair therein!'),
 (57,236,71,39,NULL,'The Unbelievers will be led to Hell in crowds:until,when they arrive there,its gate will be opened.'),
 (58,236,72,39,NULL,'(To Them) will be said: "Enter you the gates of Hell, to dwell therein:and evil is (this) abode of the arrogant!"'),
