 (63,237,43,14,NULL,'They running forward with necks outsretched,their heads uplifted, their gaze returning not towards them, and their hearts a (gaping) void!'),
 (64,237,30,24,NULL,'say to the believing men that they should lower their gaze and guard their modesty:'),
 (65,237,31,24,NULL,'And say to the beleiving women that they should lower their gaze and guard their modesty;'),
