 (191,268,1,72,NULL,'They said we have really heard a wonderful recital!'),
 (192,268,35,78,NULL,'No vanity shall they hear therein,not untruth,'),
 (193,268,2,84,NULL,'And hears to (the command of) its Lord and it must needs(do so)'),
