 (219,273,102,12,NULL,'Such is one of the story of what happened unseen, which we reveal by inspiration unto you;'),
 (220,273,30,13,NULL,'in order that you might rehearse unto them what we send down unto you by inspiration;'),
 (221,274,225,2,NULL,'Allah will not call you to account for thoughtlessness in your oaths,but for the intentions in your heart;'),
