 (264,279,121,6,NULL,'Eat not of (meats) on which Allah''s name has not been pronounced:that would be impiety.'),
 (265,279,59,21,NULL,'They said,"who has done this to ours gods? He must indeed be some man of impiety!"'),
 (266,279,21,25,NULL,'indeed they have an arrogant conceit of themselves and mighty is the insolence of their impiety'),
 (267,279,21,67,NULL,'N0, they obstinately persist in insolent impiety and fight(from the truth).'),
 (268,280,154,3,NULL,'moved by wrong suspicious of Allah suspicious due to ignorance'),
