 (312,286,45,38,NULL,'And commemorate our servants Abraham,issac and jacob,possessors of power and vision.'),
 (313,287,136,2,NULL,'say you we believe in Allah and the revelation given to us and to Abraham,ishmael,issac,jacob and that given to Moses and jesus and that given to (all) prophets from their Lord.'),
 (314,287,52,3,NULL,'When jesus found unbelieve on their part he said:"Who will be my helpers to (the work of)Allah?"'),
 (315,287,55,3,NULL,'O jesus! i will take and raise you to myself and clear you(of the falsehoods) of those who blaspheme;'),
 (316,287,59,3,NULL,'The similitude of jesus before Allah is as that of Adam;'),
 (317,287,84,3,NULL,'....and in (the Book) given to Moses,jesus, and the prophets,from their Lord.'),
 (318,287,163,4,NULL,'We sent inspiration to Abraham,ishmael,issac,jacob and the Tribes to jesus,job,jonah,Aaron,and solomom,..'),
 (319,288,112,5,NULL,'said jesus:"Fear Allah,if you have faith."'),
 (320,288,85,6,NULL,'And zakariyya and john,and jesus and Elias:all in the ranks of the Righteous:'),
 (321,288,13,42,NULL,'that which we sent by inspiration to you and that which we enjoined on Abraham,Moses and jesus:'),
 (322,288,63,43,NULL,'When jesus came with clear signs, he said :"Now have i come to you with wisdom,.."'),
 (323,288,45,3,NULL,'his name will be christ jesus, the son of Mery, held in honour in this world and the Hereafter and of (the company of) those nearest to Allah.'),
 (324,288,157,4,NULL,'That they said (in boast),"we killed christ jesus the son of mary,the messenger of Allah"'),
 (325,288,171,4,NULL,'christ jesus the son of marry,was(no more than) a mesenger of Allaj'),
 (326,288,87,2,NULL,'We gave jesus the son of marry clear (signs) and strengthened him with the holy spirit.'),
 (327,288,253,2,NULL,'To jesus the son of marry we gave slear (signs) and strengthened him with the holy spirit.'),
 (328,288,46,5,NULL,'And in their footsteps we sent joses the son of Mary,confirming the law that had come before him'),
 (329,288,78,5,NULL,'by the tongue David and jesus,the son of Mary:'),
 (330,288,110,5,NULL,'Then will Allah say:"o jesus the son of Mary!Recount my favour to you and to your mother."'),
 (331,288,116,5,NULL,'And behold!Allah will say o jesus the son of Mary!'),
 (332,289,111,2,NULL,'And they say:"None of shall enter paradise he be a jew or christian."'),
 (333,289,113,2,NULL,'The jews say The christian have naught (to send) upon and the christians say The jews have naught (to stand) upon.'),
 (334,289,120,2,NULL,'Never will the jews or the christians be satisfied with you unless you follow the religion.'),
