 (9270,3,'And Who causeth me to die, then giveth me life (again),',NULL,26,81),
 (9271,1,'And Who, I hope, will forgive me my mistakes on the day of judgment.',NULL,26,82),
 (9272,2,'"And who, I hope, will forgive me my faults on the day of Judgment.',NULL,26,82),
 (9273,3,'And Who, I ardently hope, will forgive me my sin on the Day of Judgment.',NULL,26,82),
 (9274,1,'My Lord: Grant me wisdom, and join me with the good',NULL,26,83),
 (9275,2,'"O my Lord! bestow wisdom on me, and join me with the righteous;',NULL,26,83),
 (9276,3,'My Lord! Vouchsafe me wisdom and unite me to the righteous.',NULL,26,83),
 (9277,1,'And ordain for me a goodly mention among posterity',NULL,26,84),
 (9278,2,'"Grant me honourable mention on the tongue of truth among the latest (generations);',NULL,26,84),
 (9279,3,'And give unto me a good report in later generations.',NULL,26,84),
 (9280,1,'And make me of the heirs of the garden of bliss',NULL,26,85),
 (9281,2,'"Make me one of the inheritors of the Garden of Bliss;',NULL,26,85),
 (9282,3,'And place me among the inheritors of the Garden of Delight,',NULL,26,85),
 (9283,1,'And forgive my father, for surely he is of those who have gone astray;',NULL,26,86),
 (9284,2,'"Forgive my father, for that he is among those astray;',NULL,26,86),
 (9285,3,'And forgive my father. Lo! he is of those who err.',NULL,26,86),
 (9286,1,'And disgrace me not on the day when they are raised',NULL,26,87),
 (9287,2,'"And let me not be in disgrace on the Day when (men) will be raised up;-',NULL,26,87),
 (9288,3,'And abase me not on the day when they are raised,',NULL,26,87),
 (9289,1,'The day on which property will not avail, nor sons',NULL,26,88),
 (9290,2,'"The Day whereon neither wealth nor sons will avail,',NULL,26,88),
 (9291,3,'The day when wealth and sons avail not (any man)',NULL,26,88),
 (9292,1,'Except him who comes to Allah with a heart free (from evil).',NULL,26,89),
 (9293,2,'"But only he (will prosper) that brings to Allah a sound heart;',NULL,26,89),
 (9294,3,'Save him who bringeth unto Allah a whole heart.',NULL,26,89),
 (9295,1,'And the garden shall be brought near for those who guard (against evil),',NULL,26,90),
 (9296,2,'"To the righteous, the Garden will be brought near,',NULL,26,90),
 (9297,3,'And the Garden will be brought nigh for those who ward off (evil).',NULL,26,90),
 (9298,1,'And the hell shall be made manifest to the erring ones,',NULL,26,91),
 (9299,2,'"And to those straying in Evil, the Fire will be placed in full view;',NULL,26,91),
 (9300,3,'And hell will appear plainly to the erring.',NULL,26,91),
 (9301,1,'And it shall be said to them: Where are those that you used to worship;',NULL,26,92),
 (9302,2,'"And it shall be said to them: ''Where are the (gods) ye worshipped-',NULL,26,92),
 (9303,3,'And it will be said unto them: Where is (all) that ye used to worship',NULL,26,92),
 (9304,1,'Besides Allah? Can they help you or yet help themselves?',NULL,26,93),
 (9305,2,'"''Besides Allah? Can they help you or help themselves?''',NULL,26,93),
 (9306,3,'Instead of Allah? Can they help you or help themselves?',NULL,26,93),
 (9307,1,'So they shall be thrown down into it, they and the erring ones,',NULL,26,94),
