 (14688,3,'Nay, but the Hour (of doom) is their appointed tryst, and the Hour will be more wretched and more bitter (than their earthly failure).',NULL,54,46),
 (14689,1,'Surely the guilty are in error and distress.',NULL,54,47),
 (14690,2,'Truly those in sin are the ones straying in mind, and mad.',NULL,54,47),
 (14691,3,'Lo! the guilty are in error and madness.',NULL,54,47),
 (14692,1,'On the day when they shall be dragged upon their faces into the fire; taste the touch of hell.',NULL,54,48),
 (14693,2,'The Day they will be dragged through the Fire on their faces, (they will hear:) "Taste ye the touch of Hell!"',NULL,54,48),
 (14694,3,'On the day when they are dragged into the Fire upon their faces (it is said unto them): Feel the touch of hell.',NULL,54,48),
 (14695,1,'Surely We have created everything according to a measure.',NULL,54,49),
 (14696,2,'Verily, all things have We created in proportion and measure.',NULL,54,49),
 (14697,3,'Lo! We have created every thing by measure.',NULL,54,49),
 (14698,1,'And Our command is but one, as the twinkling of an eye.',NULL,54,50),
 (14699,2,'And Our Command is but a single (Act),- like the twinkling of an eye.',NULL,54,50),
 (14700,3,'And Our commandment is but one (commandment), as the twinkling of an eye.',NULL,54,50),
 (14701,1,'And certainly We have already destroyed the likes of you, but is there anyone who will mind?',NULL,54,51),
 (14702,2,'And (oft) in the past, have We destroyed gangs like unto you: then is there any that will receive admonition?',NULL,54,51),
 (14703,3,'And verily We have destroyed your fellows; but is there any that remembereth?',NULL,54,51),
 (14704,1,'And everything they have done is in the writings.',NULL,54,52),
 (14705,2,'All that they do is noted in (their) Books (of Deeds):',NULL,54,52),
 (14706,3,'And every thing they did is in the scriptures,',NULL,54,52),
 (14707,1,'And everything small and great is written down.',NULL,54,53),
