 (16743,3,'Nay, but when the life cometh up to the throat',NULL,75,26),
 (16744,1,'And it is said: Who will be a magician?',NULL,75,27),
 (16745,2,'And there will be a cry, "Who is a magician (to restore him)?"',NULL,75,27),
 (16746,3,'And men say: Where is the wizard (who can save him now)?',NULL,75,27),
